-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §39 גמולי תפקיד אשר ימשיכו להתקיים ברפורמה:
-- the role allowances that go on under the reform, each at its rate of the
-- combined salary; the base for them; at most two of them; the
-- special-education allowance of one teaching in ordinary and
-- special-education classes; and the old rules for them, save reductions
-- of hours.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `39 גמולי תפקיד אשר ימשיכו להתקיים ברפורמה`

@desc A role a teacher under the reform may hold, with the facts its rate turns on.
DECLARE `role` IS ONE OF
    `homeroom teacher`
    `homeroom teacher of a first grade`
    `special-education teacher in a primary or junior high school` HAS `special-education rate` IS A NUMBER @desc 5.5%, 8.5%, 9% or 14%, by the eligibility rules of the eve of the signing (an input)
    `integrating teacher` HAS `integration rate` IS A NUMBER @desc 5.5% or 9%, by the eligibility rules of the eve of the signing (an input)
    `subject coordinator` HAS `coordinator stage` IS A `school stage`
    `road-safety coordinator`
    `security coordinator`
    `social-education coordinator` HAS `social stage` IS A `school stage`
    `grade coordinator` HAS `classes in the grade` IS A NUMBER
    `laboratory coordinator`
    `evaluation and measurement coordinator`

-- (א)(1)–(11): the rates. (9): "מעל 4 כיתות" 6% and "עד 4 כיתות" 7%. By
-- convention thresholds.above "מעל 4" leaves 4 out, and by
-- thresholds.until so would "עד 4"; a grade of exactly 4 classes would then
-- be in neither, so "עד 4" is read to include 4 (the exception recorded
-- under thresholds.until).
@ref akn:art_39__para_a akn:art_39__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_39__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_39__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_39__para_a__subpara_4 akn:art_39__para_a__subpara_5 akn:art_39__para_a__subpara_5/p2 akn:art_39__para_a__subpara_6 akn:art_39__para_a__subpara_7 akn:art_39__para_a__subpara_8 akn:art_39__para_a__subpara_8/p2 akn:art_39__para_a__subpara_9 akn:art_39__para_a__subpara_9/p2 akn:art_39__para_a__subpara_10 akn:art_39__para_a__subpara_11
GIVEN r IS A `role`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the role rate` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `homeroom teacher` THEN 10%
    WHEN `homeroom teacher of a first grade` THEN 11.5%
    WHEN `special-education teacher in a primary or junior high school` rate THEN rate
    WHEN `integrating teacher` rate THEN rate
    WHEN `subject coordinator` s THEN IF s EQUALS `a primary school` THEN 6% ELSE 8%
    WHEN `road-safety coordinator` THEN 6%
    WHEN `security coordinator` THEN 6%
    WHEN `social-education coordinator` s THEN IF s EQUALS `a primary school` THEN 6% ELSE 10%
    WHEN `grade coordinator` classes THEN IF classes GREATER THAN 4 THEN 6% ELSE 7%
    WHEN `laboratory coordinator` THEN 3%
    WHEN `evaluation and measurement coordinator` THEN 6%

-- The rates (3) and (4) may take, as printed.
GIVEN r IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a special-education rate (3) names` r IF
    elem r (LIST 5.5%, 8.5%, 9%, 14%)

GIVEN r IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an integration rate (4) names` r IF
    elem r (LIST 5.5%, 9%)

GIVEN r IS A `role`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a special-education allowance` r IF
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `special-education teacher in a primary or junior high school` rate THEN TRUE
    WHEN `integrating teacher` rate THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

@desc A teacher's position and pay, as far as §39 asks.
DECLARE `allowance case` HAS
    `full-position combined salary` IS A NUMBER @desc from §35's tables, an input
    `position fraction`             IS A NUMBER
    `frontal hours`                 IS A NUMBER
    `frontal hours in special-education classes` IS A NUMBER

-- (א)(11) ¶2: but for (3) and (4), "שכר משולב" is the full-position
-- combined salary, so long as the teacher is employed a third of a position
-- or more. For (3) and (4) it is the teacher's own, by the position; and
-- (ג): for the special-education allowance of one teaching in ordinary and
-- special-education classes, the position is read by the share of the
-- frontal hours in special-education classes — the reading adopted: that
-- share of the position held.
@ref akn:art_39__para_a__subpara_11/p2 akn:art_39__para_c
GIVEN c IS A `allowance case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the special-education position` c IS
    IF c's `frontal hours` GREATER THAN 0
    THEN c's `position fraction` TIMES (c's `frontal hours in special-education classes` DIVIDED BY c's `frontal hours`)
    ELSE 0

GIVEN r IS A `role`, c IS A `allowance case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the role allowance` r c IS
    IF `a special-education allowance` r
    THEN `the role rate` r TIMES c's `full-position combined salary` TIMES `the special-education position` c
    ELSE IF c's `position fraction` AT LEAST 1/3
         THEN `the role rate` r TIMES c's `full-position combined salary`
         ELSE 0

-- (ב): at most two role allowances, unless the district manager approved
-- one more; the special-education allowance does not count among them.
-- F-ofek-hadash-base-39-a: the clause caps their number and does not say
-- which two a teacher holding more is paid. The reading adopted (convention
-- amounts.highest): the two highest.
@ref akn:art_39__para_b
GIVEN `approved by the district manager` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `role allowances payable at most` `approved by the district manager` IS
    IF `approved by the district manager` THEN 3 ELSE 2

-- With the district manager's approval, three; the ownership circulars'
-- "at most two" has no such exception (F-2025-26_tashpo_01-t).
#ASSERT `role allowances payable at most` TRUE EQUALS 3

-- The agreement's claim for the root (MMS-521, MMS-552): of the roles a
-- teacher holds, how many role allowances (ב) pays — two, or three where
-- the district manager approved one more. It speaks for any teaching
-- employee on Ofek Hadash terms from the month the agreement was signed,
-- December 2008: the case does not say when the teacher's school joined
-- the reform, and the root asks of it only from 2017.
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the role allowances counted according to the base agreement` c IS
    IF `the salary month is at least` c 2008 12
    THEN JUST (min (c's `the roles the teacher holds`)
                   (`role allowances payable at most` (c's `a further role approved by the district manager`)))
    ELSE NOTHING

-- How the agreement describes itself as an instrument (MMS-521), for the root.
`the base agreement §39` MEANS
    `instrument` WITH
        `module`        IS "base-agreement-39"
        `title`         IS "הסכם אופק חדש מיום 25.12.2008"
        `kind`          IS `a collective agreement`
        `is the takanon` IS FALSE
        `issued`        IS DATE_FROM_DMY 25 12 2008
        `practised for all state employees` IS FALSE
        `approved by the Finance Minister`  IS FALSE

GIVEN c IS A `allowance case`
      `approved by the district manager` IS A BOOLEAN
      roles IS A LIST OF `role`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the role allowances paid` c `approved by the district manager` roles IS
        sum (map (GIVEN r YIELD `the role allowance` r c) (filter `a special-education allowance` roles))
    PLUS sum (take (`role allowances payable at most` `approved by the district manager`)
                   (sortBy (GIVEN a, b YIELD a AT LEAST b)
                           (map (GIVEN r YIELD `the role allowance` r c)
                                (filter (GIVEN r YIELD NOT `a special-education allowance` r) roles))))

-- (ד): the rules and conditions of these allowances before the reform go
-- on, save those on reducing hours: no allowance is paid by adding or
-- taking hours off the position.
@ref akn:art_39__para_d
DECLARE `form of an allowance` IS ONE OF `a percentage of the combined salary`, `hours added to or taken off the position`

GIVEN f IS A `form of an allowance`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an allowance may be paid as` f IF
    f EQUALS `a percentage of the combined salary`

-- Worked examples; a full-position combined salary of 8,000 is a placeholder.
`a full-time teacher on 8,000` MEANS
    `allowance case` WITH
        `full-position combined salary` IS 8000
        `position fraction`             IS 1
        `frontal hours`                 IS 26
        `frontal hours in special-education classes` IS 13

#ASSERT `the role allowance` `homeroom teacher` `a full-time teacher on 8,000` EQUALS 800
#ASSERT `the role allowance` (`grade coordinator` 4) `a full-time teacher on 8,000` EQUALS 560
#ASSERT `the role allowance` (`grade coordinator` 5) `a full-time teacher on 8,000` EQUALS 480
-- Half the frontal hours in special education at 14%: 14% × 8,000 × 1/2.
#ASSERT `the role allowance` (`special-education teacher in a primary or junior high school` (14%)) `a full-time teacher on 8,000` EQUALS 560
-- Three roles, no approval: the two highest (10% and 8%) and not the 6%.
#ASSERT `the role allowances paid` `a full-time teacher on 8,000` FALSE (LIST `homeroom teacher`, `subject coordinator` `a junior high school`, `security coordinator`) EQUALS 1440
-- The rule pays a fixed full-position allowance down to a third of a position.
`a third-time teacher on 8,000` MEANS
    `allowance case` WITH
        `full-position combined salary` IS 8000
        `position fraction`             IS 1/3
        `frontal hours`                 IS 8
        `frontal hours in special-education classes` IS 0
#ASSERT `the role allowance` `homeroom teacher` `a third-time teacher on 8,000` EQUALS 800

-- F-ofek-hadash-base-39-a's evidence: three roles are held, two are paid,
-- and which two changes the pay.
`three roles held, two paid` MEANS
        count (LIST `homeroom teacher`, `subject coordinator` `a junior high school`, `security coordinator`)
            GREATER THAN `role allowances payable at most` FALSE
    AND NOT (`the role rate` `homeroom teacher` EQUALS `the role rate` `security coordinator`)
#ASSERT `three roles held, two paid`

-- F-ofek-hadash-base-39-b: "ובלבד שעובד ההוראה הועסק ב- 1/3 משרה לפחות"
-- may make a third of a position the condition of the allowance, or only
-- of its full-position base (below a third, the allowance on the teacher's
-- own salary). The reading adopted (convention reading.condition): the
-- condition of the allowance, so below a third none is paid.
`a teacher at 30% on 8,000` MEANS
    `allowance case` WITH
        `full-position combined salary` IS 8000
        `position fraction`             IS 0.3
        `frontal hours`                 IS 8
        `frontal hours in special-education classes` IS 0
`the two readings part below a third of a position` MEANS
        `the role allowance` `homeroom teacher` `a teacher at 30% on 8,000` EQUALS 0
    AND `the role rate` `homeroom teacher` TIMES 8000 TIMES 0.3 GREATER THAN 0
#ASSERT `the two readings part below a third of a position`

-- Over the grade sizes 1 to 12: every grade coordinator has one rate,
-- 7% to 4 classes and 6% above.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD `the role rate` (`grade coordinator` n) EQUALS (IF n AT MOST 4 THEN 7% ELSE 6%)) (range 1 12)
#ASSERT `a special-education rate (3) names` (8.5%) AND NOT `an integration rate (4) names` (8.5%)
